<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH F.A. CUP FIFTH ROUND DRAW.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH F.A. CUP FIFTH ROUND DRAW.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Draw for the fifth round of the</p>
<p>English Football Association (F.A.) Cup made on Sunday:</p>
<p>Birmingham v Peterborough or Wrexham</p>
<p>Leicester v Chelsea</p>
<p>Manchester United or Wimbledon v Queens Park Rangers</p>
<p>Bolton or Chesterfield v Nottingham Forest</p>
<p>Bradford v Sheffield Wednesday</p>
<p>Manchester City or Watford v Middlesbrough</p>
<p>Arsenal or Leeds v Portsmouth</p>
<p>Derby v Blackburn or Coventry or Woking</p>
<p>Ties to played on February 15 or 16.</p>
</text>
